  q: "A 9-month-old infant is evaluated for developmental delay and seizures. He has fair skin, blonde hair, and blue eyes. His mother mentions a distinct 'musty' or 'mousy' odor to his sweat and urine. Which enzyme is most likely deficient in this patient?",
